==Translingual==

===Punctuation mark===
{{head|mul|punctuation mark}}

# {{non-gloss definition|An [[emoticon]] representing [[frustration]] or [[headdesk]]}}

====Usage notes====
This is seen as a picture of a stick figure kneeling down (facing left) and banging its head against the ground, with the O as its head, the T as its torso and arms, and the L as its legs.

